Fix PHP 8 "Automatic conversion of false to array" in basket actions.

On PHP 8.x, $this->session->get("basket") returns false when no basket
exists in the session.  PHP 8 no longer silently converts false to an
empty array when the [] operator is used, causing the basket add/remove
actions to fail.  Initialise $basket to an empty array with ?: array().

